@startuml
title Discover Peers

|End-user|
start

:Identify roles and activities;
:Choose potential CDNs;
|Mediator|
:Pass service requirements;
|Peering Agent|
:Perform resource discovery;
:Predict peer performance;
:Work around sharing limits;
if (Any peering policies exist?) then (yes)
:Return peering policies;
stop
else (no)
:Perform short-term negotiation;
|Mediator|
:Interact with external PAs;
|Policy Agent|
:Discover external resources;
:Negotiate with selected peers;
if (Sufficient resources acquired?) then (yes)
:Establish peering arrangement;
stop
else (no)
endif
|Mediator|
:Re-evaluate service requirements;
:Send requirements for renegotiation;
stop
endif

@enduml